{"id":"mtk-c4-luas","title":"Luas Bangun Datar","subject":"matematika","fase":["C"],"kelas":[5,6],"elemen":["Pengukuran","Geometri"],"packId":"mtk-c4","summary":"Rumus luas segitiga, jajargenjang, trapesium, layang-layang, dan lingkaran, serta luas bangun gabungan.","objectives":["menurunkan rumus luas segitiga dari persegi panjang","menghitung luas jajargenjang, trapesium, dan layang-layang","menghitung keliling dan luas lingkaran","menghitung luas bangun gabungan"],"sections":[{"id":"segitiga","title":"Dari persegi panjang ke segitiga","html":"\n      <figure class=\"lesson-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 290 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Persegi panjang 6 kali 4 satuan\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"50\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"80\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"110\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"50\" y=\"20\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"50\" y=\"80\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"50\" y=\"110\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"20\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"50\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"80\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"110\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"110\" y=\"20\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"110\" y=\"50\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"110\" y=\"80\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"110\" y=\"110\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"20\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"50\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"80\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"110\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"170\" y=\"20\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"170\" y=\"50\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"170\" y=\"80\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"170\" y=\"110\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"180\" height=\"120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1b1e2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"160\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Figtree\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">6 satuan</text><text x=\"208\" y=\"84\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Figtree\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">4 satuan</text></svg><figcaption>Luas = 6 × 4 = 24 persegi satuan, keliling = 2 × (6 + 4) = 20 satuan.</figcaption></figure>\n      <p>Potong persegi panjang di atas pada diagonalnya: terbentuk dua segitiga yang sama besar. Jadi luas segitiga adalah setengah dari alas × tinggi.</p>\n      <div class=\"two\"><div class=\"rumus-box\"><span class=\"lbl\">Segitiga</span>\\(L = \\tfrac12 \\times a \\times t\\)</div><div class=\"rumus-box\"><span class=\"lbl\">Jajargenjang</span>\\(L = a \\times t\\)</div></div>\n      <div class=\"ingat\">Tinggi selalu tegak lurus terhadap alas, bukan sisi miringnya.</div>"},{"id":"lain","title":"Trapesium dan layang-layang","html":"\n      <div class=\"two\"><div class=\"rumus-box\"><span class=\"lbl\">Trapesium</span>\\(L = \\tfrac12 \\times (\\text{jumlah sisi sejajar}) \\times t\\)</div><div class=\"rumus-box\"><span class=\"lbl\">Layang-layang dan belah ketupat</span>\\(L = \\tfrac12 \\times d_1 \\times d_2\\)</div></div>"},{"id":"lingkaran","title":"Lingkaran","html":"\n      <div class=\"two\"><div class=\"rumus-box\"><span class=\"lbl\">Keliling</span>\\(K = 2\\pi r = \\pi d\\)</div><div class=\"rumus-box\"><span class=\"lbl\">Luas</span>\\(L = \\pi r^2\\)</div></div>\n      <p>Pakai \\(\\pi = \\tfrac{22}{7}\\) jika jari-jari kelipatan 7, dan \\(\\pi = 3{,}14\\) untuk lainnya. Jika jari-jari dijadikan 2 kali, luasnya menjadi 4 kali, karena r muncul dua kali (r × r).</p>"},{"id":"gabungan","title":"Bangun gabungan","html":"\n      <p>Pecah menjadi bangun-bangun yang rumusnya kamu tahu, hitung masing-masing, lalu jumlahkan. Persegi 10 × 10 dengan setengah lingkaran berdiameter 10 di atasnya: 100 + \\(\\tfrac12 \\times 3{,}14 \\times 5^2\\) = 100 + 39,25 = 139,25.</p>"}]}